          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As a",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " shopper on Automation Exercise (and as a partner app using our public product API)"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I want",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " to browse the full catalogue and search it by a free-text term"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "So that",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " I can quickly find the clothes I'm looking for."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Context"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "bulletList",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "UI: the "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Products",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "strong"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " page ("
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "/products",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ") shows the whole catalogue under the heading \"All Products\" and has a search box (\"Search Product\") with a search button."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "API (same host, form-encoded requests):"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "GET /api/productsList",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "code"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " — the whole catalogue."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "POST /api/searchProduct",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "code"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " with the parameter "
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "search_product",
                              "marks": [
                                {
                                  "type": "code"
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": " — the products matching the term."
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Search terms are plain words or phrases, for example "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "jean",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "top",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "dress",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Men Tshirt",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "code"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Out of scope for this story: punctuation and special characters in search terms (tracked separately), sorting, pagination, cart."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance criteria"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "codeBlock",
          "attrs": {
            "language": "gherkin"
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Feature: Product catalogue and search\n\n  Scenario: AC-1 Catalogue is available through the API\n    When a client calls GET /api/productsList\n    Then the response lists the products of the catalogue in a \"products\" array\n    And every product has an \"id\", a \"name\", a \"price\", a \"brand\" and a \"category\"\n    And the category holds the audience (\"usertype\", e.g. Women, Men, Kids) and the category name\n    And every price is written as \"Rs. \" followed by the amount, e.g. \"Rs. 500\"\n\n  Scenario: AC-2 Search by a term through the API\n    When a client posts search_product = \"jean\" to /api/searchProduct\n    Then exactly these products are returned: \"Soft Stretch Jeans\", \"Regular Fit Straight Jeans\", \"Grunt Blue Slim Fit Jeans\"\n\n  Scenario: AC-3 Search ignores letter case\n    When a client searches for \"TOP\" and for \"top\"\n    Then both searches return the same products\n\n  Scenario: AC-4 Search matches product names\n    When a client searches for \"dress\"\n    Then every product returned has the term in its product name\n    And every catalogue product whose name contains \"dress\" is returned\n\n  Scenario: AC-5 Nothing matches\n    When a client searches for \"zzqxv\"\n    Then an empty product list is returned, not an error\n\n  Scenario: AC-6 Search without a term (empty value)\n    When a client posts search_product with an empty value\n    Then the whole catalogue is returned, the same products as GET /api/productsList\n\n  Scenario: AC-7 Search without a term (parameter missing)\n    When a client posts to /api/searchProduct without the search_product parameter\n    Then the request is rejected with response code 400\n    And the message is \"Bad request, search_product parameter is missing in POST request.\"\n\n  Scenario: AC-8 Search from the Products page\n    Given a shopper on the Products page\n    When they type \"jean\" in the search box and press the search button\n    Then the product grid is headed \"Searched Products\"\n    And the search box still shows \"jean\"\n    And exactly the three jeans products listed in AC-2 are shown\n\n  Scenario: AC-9 Searching from the Products page without a term\n    Given a shopper on the Products page\n    When they leave the search box empty and press the search button\n    Then the grid is headed \"All Products\"\n    And every product of the catalogue (GET /api/productsList) is shown\n\n  Scenario Outline: AC-10 The shop and the API agree on search results\n    When a shopper searches for \"<term>\" on the Products page\n    Then the products shown are exactly the products POST /api/searchProduct returns for \"<term>\"\n\n    Examples:\n      | term       |\n      | top        |\n      | dress      |\n      | Men Tshirt |\n\n  Scenario: AC-11 No results on the Products page\n    When a shopper searches for \"zzqxv\" on the Products page\n    Then the grid is headed \"Searched Products\" and no product is shown"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "attachment": [],
